---

---

<section
  class="py-14 md:py-16 bg-white dark:bg-[#0a0f1a] relative overflow-hidden transition-colors duration-300"
>
  <!-- Subtle grid pattern -->
  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.02] dark:opacity-[0.04]"
    style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0,255,178,0.3) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,255,178,0.3) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 60px 60px;"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-16 max-w-7xl relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center mb-10">
      <span
        class="inline-block py-1.5 px-3 bg-red-500/10 dark:bg-red-500/20 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 font-sans font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-xs sm:text-sm mb-4 border-l-4 border-red-500"
      >
        Alerta para Fundadores
      </span>
      <h2
        class="font-sans text-3xl sm:text-4xl 2xl:text-5xl font-extrabold text-constival-navy dark:text-white tracking-tight"
      >
        Lo que nadie te cuenta <span class="text-red-500 dark:text-red-400"
          >antes de constituir.</span
        >
      </h2>
      <p
        class="font-sans text-base md:text-lg text-constival-navy/60 dark:text-slate-400 mt-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto"
      >
        Si buscas crear una empresa en Ecuador, evita las "fábricas de trámites" que venden plantillas de internet. Estas son las consecuencias reales de constituir tu SAS sin un diseño corporativo a medida.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 md:gap-5">
      <!-- Risk 1: Bank rejection -->
      <div
        class="group relative bg-gray-50 dark:bg-constival-deep/50 p-6 border border-constival-navy/5 dark:border-white/5 hover:border-red-500/30 dark:hover:border-red-400/30 transition-all duration-500 overflow-hidden"
      >
        <div
          class="absolute top-0 left-0 h-0.5 w-0 bg-red-500 group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-700"
        >
        </div>
        <div
          class="text-red-500/10 dark:text-red-400/5 font-sans font-black text-6xl absolute -right-1 -top-2 select-none pointer-events-none"
        >
          !
        </div>
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 mb-4 text-red-500 dark:text-red-400">
            <svg
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              ><path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                d="M2.25 8.25h19.5M2.25 9h19.5m-16.5 5.25h6m-6 2.25h3m-3.75 3h15a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25V6.75A2.25 2.25 0 0019.5 4.5h-15a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25v10.5A2.25 2.25 0 004.5 19.5z"
              ></path></svg
            >
          </div>
          <h3
            class="font-sans text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-constival-navy dark:text-white mb-2"
          >
            Bancos que <span class="text-red-500">rechazan tu cuenta</span>
          </h3>
          <p
            class="text-constival-navy/60 dark:text-slate-400 font-sans leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base"
          >
            Cuando llegas al banco con estatutos genéricos o un objeto social
            ambiguo, la institución financiera te niega la apertura de cuenta
            corporativa. Sin cuenta, tu SAS no puede operar ni facturar.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Risk 2: SCVS rejection -->
      <div
        class="group relative bg-gray-50 dark:bg-constival-deep/50 p-6 border border-constival-navy/5 dark:border-white/5 hover:border-red-500/30 dark:hover:border-red-400/30 transition-all duration-500 overflow-hidden"
      >
        <div
          class="absolute top-0 left-0 h-0.5 w-0 bg-red-500 group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-700"
        >
        </div>
        <div
          class="text-red-500/10 dark:text-red-400/5 font-sans font-black text-6xl absolute -right-1 -top-2 select-none pointer-events-none"
        >
          !
        </div>
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 mb-4 text-red-500 dark:text-red-400">
            <svg
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              ><path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                d="M19.5 14.25v-2.625a3.375 3.375 0 00-3.375-3.375h-1.5A1.125 1.125 0 0113.5 7.125v-1.5a3.375 3.375 0 00-3.375-3.375H8.25m6.75 12H9.75m-1.5-3h7.5M8.25 2.25H4.875c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v17.25c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125h14.25c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V11.25a9 9 0 00-9-9z"
              ></path></svg
            >
          </div>
          <h3
            class="font-sans text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-constival-navy dark:text-white mb-2"
          >
            Expediente <span class="text-red-500">devuelto por la SCVS</span>
          </h3>
          <p
            class="text-constival-navy/60 dark:text-slate-400 font-sans leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base"
          >
            Un error de forma en el acta constitutiva o en las firmas
            electrónicas y la Superintendencia rechaza el trámite completo. Cada
            reingreso puede costarte semanas adicionales y hasta el doble de
            aranceles.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Risk 3: Unprotected before investors -->
      <div
        class="group relative bg-gray-50 dark:bg-constival-deep/50 p-6 border border-constival-navy/5 dark:border-white/5 hover:border-red-500/30 dark:hover:border-red-400/30 transition-all duration-500 overflow-hidden"
      >
        <div
          class="absolute top-0 left-0 h-0.5 w-0 bg-red-500 group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-700"
        >
        </div>
        <div
          class="text-red-500/10 dark:text-red-400/5 font-sans font-black text-6xl absolute -right-1 -top-2 select-none pointer-events-none"
        >
          !
        </div>
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 mb-4 text-red-500 dark:text-red-400">
            <svg
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              ><path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285z"
              ></path></svg
            >
          </div>
          <h3
            class="font-sans text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-constival-navy dark:text-white mb-2"
          >
            Patrimonio <span class="text-red-500">sin blindaje real</span>
          </h3>
          <p
            class="text-constival-navy/60 dark:text-slate-400 font-sans leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base"
          >
            Las plantillas de internet no incluyen cláusulas de limitación
            patrimonial, restricciones de transferencia de acciones ni mecanismos
            de resolución de conflictos. Cuando necesites un inversor o quieras
            vender, tu sociedad no valdrá nada.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 text-center">
      <p
        class="font-serif italic text-base md:text-lg text-constival-teal dark:text-constival-mint/70 mb-5"
      >
        "La diferencia entre una empresa que sobrevive y una que escala está en
        los 3 primeros documentos que firmó el fundador."
      </p>
      <a
        href="#cotizador-interactivo"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-sans font-bold text-sm md:text-base uppercase tracking-wider text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 bg-red-500/10 hover:bg-red-500/20 px-6 py-3 md:py-3.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98]"
      >
        Constituir mi SAS con blindaje real
        <svg
          class="w-4 h-4"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          ><path
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            stroke-width="2"
            d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path></svg
        >
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
